              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amadodana ka-Eliyezeri: nguRehabiya inhloko. U-Eliyezeri wayengenawo amanye amadodana; kodwa amadodana kaRehabiya ayemaningi kakhulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
