              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lawa angamadodana kaLevi ngezindlu zawoyise; nezinhloko zezindlu zawoyise, zabalwayo kubo ngokwenani lamagama ngamavoti azo, abenza umsebenzi wenkonzo yendlu kaJehova, kusukela kwabaneminyaka engamashumi amabili kuya phezulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.23.24",
