              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "futhi okwesinkwa sokubukwa, nempuphu ecolekileyo ibe ngumnikelo wempuphu, namaqebelengwane angenamvubelo, nawokubhakwa epanini, nakoko okuthosiweyo, nangaso sonke isilinganiso nesayizi;",
          "type": "text",
